Our Wines | wines
<main id="main">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="hex"></span>The collection</p>
          <h1 class="d1">Ten wines,<br><span class="i">one island.</span></h1>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">Vassaltis is dedicated to Santorini’s native grapes: Assyrtiko above all, but also Aidani, Athiri, Mandilaria and Mavrotragano. Each wine is held in the cellar until it’s ready to drink on release.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="filter" role="group" aria-label="Filter wines">
        <button class="chip" aria-pressed="true" data-f="all">All ten</button>
        <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-f="White">White</button>
        <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-f="Red">Red</button>
        <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-f="Sparkling">Sparkling</button>
        <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-f="Sweet">Sweet</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:0">
      <p class="sr" id="count" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px"></p>
      <div class="cellar" id="cellar"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">In the cellar</p><h2 class="d2">Taste them where they’re made.</h2></div>
        <a class="btn light" href="visit.html">Plan a tasting</a>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:40em">Current vintages and rare vinifications are poured in the tasting room. Some, like the Aidani, are only offered there. The club site handles member releases; its shop is currently closed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
